h></svg></button></div></div></h2><p>I realize that the introduction (i.e.,=
 everything up to this point) turned out to be much longer than I expected.=
 Nonetheless, I think that this lengthy introduction is perhaps necessary t=
o put the following lessons into context.</p><p>After going through a large=
 number of recent papers on reasoning models last month, I have put togethe=
r a summary of the most interesting ideas and insights in this section. (Re=
